<title>USA: RESEARCH ALERT - FaxSav started as buy.</title>
<headline>RESEARCH ALERT - FaxSav started as buy.</headline>
<text>
<p>-- Lehman Brothers said it started coverage of FaxSav Inc with a buy.</p>
<p>-- The stock slipped 1/8 to 5-1/4.</p>
